{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>Hod is before Him</b> — before Him alone, not before the idols of the nations." "<b>In His sanctuary:</b> the heavens are from the heaven of His holiness, or the Ark, which is called עֹז, in the Temple — and this is the correct interpretation. The reason: the heavens are the dwellings of the stars, and the Temple is a house of habitation for Him."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 96, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:23.714123807Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}